@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title AFTER MVP — Proposed / conditional — Conditional environment promotion and exact approval gates
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Exact artifact identity + usable protected bytes\ncode / definition / build provenance" as A
rectangle "Development target\nif actually established" as D
rectangle "Staging target\nif actually established" as S
rectangle "Production target\nif actually established" as P
rectangle "Current target-specific approval / config / data / recovery gate" as GD
rectangle "Current target-specific approval / config / data / recovery gate" as GS
rectangle "Current target-specific approval / config / data / recovery gate" as GP
A --> GD
GD --> D
D ..> GS : evidence may inform next decision, not grant approval
GS --> S
S ..> GP : same exact artifact if that is reviewed promotion contract
GP --> P
note bottom of A
 Environment names are logical examples, not three purchased or configured hosts.
 Rebuild creates a different artifact and requires its own provenance/approval evaluation.
end note

@enduml
